# Xcode asset catalogues inside the widget target.
#
# `@bacons/apple-targets` writes these from the `colors` block in
# expo-target.config.js, in Xcode's own JSON style — so Prettier and the
# plugin would take turns reformatting them, and `format:check` would
# fail on any machine that had run prebuild more recently than the last
# format. The Swift beside them is still ours; only the generated
# catalogue is exempt.
targets/**/Assets.xcassets
.vercel
